<figure class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-2 border-ink p-4 sm:p-6">
<p class="font-bold">Every voter is consistent. The majority goes round in a circle.</p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto border-2 border-ink"><table class="w-full text-base">
<thead><tr class="border-b-2 border-ink"><th class="p-2 text-left">Voter</th><th class="p-2">First</th><th class="p-2">Second</th><th class="p-2">Third</th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr class="border-b border-ink"><th class="p-2 text-left">1</th><td class="p-2 text-center">A</td><td class="p-2 text-center">B</td><td class="p-2 text-center">C</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-ink"><th class="p-2 text-left">2</th><td class="p-2 text-center">B</td><td class="p-2 text-center">C</td><td class="p-2 text-center">A</td></tr><tr><th class="p-2 text-left">3</th><td class="p-2 text-center">C</td><td class="p-2 text-center">A</td><td class="p-2 text-center">B</td></tr></tbody>
</table></div>
<svg viewBox="0 0 440 180" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-lg" role="img" aria-labelledby="condorcet-title condorcet-desc">
<title id="condorcet-title">The majority cycle is A beats B, B beats C, C beats A</title><desc id="condorcet-desc">Three arrows form a triangle, each showing a majority vote of two to one.</desc>
<defs><marker id="vote-arrow" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L6 3 L0 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/></marker></defs>
<g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#vote-arrow)"><path d="M125 45 H308"/><path d="M344 69 L245 154"/><path d="M194 155 L98 69"/></g>
<g fill="currentColor" font-size="22" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold"><text x="90" y="47">A</text><text x="346" y="47">B</text><text x="220" y="172">C</text></g>
<g fill="currentColor" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle"><text x="220" y="33">2–1</text><text x="302" y="121">2–1</text><text x="138" y="120">2–1</text></g>
</svg>
<figcaption class="text-base leading-normal">Two voters prefer A to B. Two prefer B to C. And two prefer C to A. The deciding pairs of voters are different, so perfectly sensible rankings can create a cycle.</figcaption></figure>